{#- C3-07 Stage 1: the manufacturer roster Partner 360's shop landing page reads, so the storefront and the
    website always show the same partners. Built from activeManufacturers (manufacturers.json without the hidden
    ones) — the same list every website logo row and card grid uses. Public marketing facts only: id, name,
    category, a short description and the website's own partner-card artwork. Never prices or account data. -#}
{%- set out = [] -%}
{%- for m in activeManufacturers -%}
{%- set out = (out.push({ id: m.id, name: m.name, category: m.category or "", description: m.description or "", image: "/assets/manufacturers/partners/" + m.id + ".jpg", logo: m.logo or "", page: "/manufacturers/" + m.id + "/" }), out) -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ { version: 1, partners: out } | dump | safe }}
